  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"1998-10-30T09:31:00Z\"\u003e30 October 1998\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Luxton Welcomes Lifting Of Fruit Ban \n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        John Luxton\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Food, Fibre, Biosecurity and Border Control\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinister of Food and Fibre, John Luxton, today welcomed China lifting their ban on New Zealand fruit. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;China has huge potential for New Zealand Fruit,\u0026#34; Mr Luxton said. \u0026#34;The Lifting of this ban is great news.\u0026#34; \u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Minister of Food and Fibre, John Luxton, today welcomed China lifting their ban on New Zealand fruit. \"China has huge potential for New Zealand Fruit,\" Mr Luxton said. \"The Lifting of this ban is great news.\"",
